aicast.py
  The AiCast USB protocol constants, handshake and the embedded RSA public key follow
  hevnsnt/artinchip-linux (https://github.com/hevnsnt/artinchip-linux):
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Bill Swearingen (hevnsnt)
  The protocol was checked against ArtInChip's GPL-2.0 aic_drm_ud driver (Luban-Lite SDK).
  No code from that driver is included.

hidctl.py
  An independent reimplementation of the MSI Lightning control framing, written for
  interoperability. No MSI code or assets are included.

wvread.py
  Read-only Thermal Grizzly WireView Pro II reader. Its struct layouts follow
  emaspa/wireview-linux (WireViewDeviceLib, wireview-hwmon).

fonts/Inter.ttf, fonts/SourceSerif4.ttf  (claude-board branch only)
  Inter (Rasmus Andersson) and Source Serif 4 (Adobe), SIL Open Font License 1.1;
  see fonts/OFL-Inter.txt and fonts/OFL-SourceSerif4.txt.

claude_board.py  (claude-board branch only, not for publishing)
  The spark logo and pixel mascot imitate Anthropic's Claude / Claude Code branding,
  for personal use on this screen.
